  <p style="color:#000000;font-size:14px; font-family: Times New Roman; ">By requesting the Guide to Understanding Head and Neck Cancer, you have taken a very important step in protecting and managing your health. As you read, carefully consider any risk factors and/or symptoms you have. You may even want to take notes in preparation for an appointment with one of our highly-trained specialists.
